---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LyricsStage from "../components/LyricsStage.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../site.config";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于 · Swim"
  description="在《Swim》的蓝色里，留下一小段关于本站之外的话。"
  overlayHeader
  bodyClass="about-page"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="about" tabindex="-1">
    <LyricsStage />

    <section class="about-note" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="about-note__inner">
        <p class="about-note__eyebrow">About the library</p>
        <h1 id="about-title" class="about-note__title">关于{siteConfig.name}</h1>
        <div class="about-note__grid">
          <div class="about-note__prose">
            <p>
              <strong>潜游书阁</strong>（{siteConfig.englishName}）是一座专为沉静长读而筑的数字藏书阁。馆名源自《SWIM》中向着微光游弋的意象——在信息喧嚣的浪潮之中，我们希望为你保留一片能让人彻底沉静心绪、潜入字里行间的深蓝海域。
            </p>
            <p>
              这里不设喧扰的社交干扰与推荐算法，每一卷书册均经过严谨的校对排版，并配备自适应深浅色域与无级字号排版引擎。无论是白昼的专注阅览，还是深夜的静心重温，都能以最契合双眼的节奏舒心沉潜。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-note__pillars">
            <div class="about-note__card">
              <h3>纯粹阅读</h3>
              <p>无广告、无弹窗、极简加载，只保留最核心的文字排版与章节索引。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-note__card">
              <h3>温润质感</h3>
              <p>专为长文阅读打磨的衬线字级、标点挤压与护眼色彩体系。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-note__card">
              <h3>离线记忆</h3>
              <p>阅读进度与偏好设置自动保存在本地，随时随地接续上次的阅读点。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body.about-page) {
    background: #030817;
  }

  :global(body.about-page :focus-visible) {
    outline-color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(3, 8, 23, 0.78);
  }

  :global(body.about-page .site-footer) {
    border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .about {
    min-height: 100svh;
    scroll-margin-top: var(--header-height);
    background: #030817;
    color: #f8faff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    outline: none;
  }

  .about-note {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding:
      clamp(56px, 9vh, 104px)
      clamp(24px, 5.5vw, 96px)
      clamp(60px, 10vh, 118px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(219, 228, 242, 0.1);
    background: #030817;
  }

  .about-note__inner {
    width: min(100%, 1400px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-note__eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: rgba(127, 169, 245, 0.85);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-note__eyebrow::before {
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    content: "";
  }

  .about-note__title {
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    color: #f2f6ff;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.16;
  }

  .about-note__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(300px, 0.8fr);
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-note__prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    color: rgba(222, 235, 255, 0.82);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .about-note__prose strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-note__pillars {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .about-note__card {
    padding: 20px 22px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(222, 235, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition:
      border-color 200ms ease,
      background-color 200ms ease,
      transform 200ms ease;
  }

  .about-note__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(127, 169, 245, 0.35);
    background: rgba(127, 169, 245, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-note__card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #7fa9f5;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .about-note__card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(213, 226, 247, 0.68);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-note__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .about-note {
      padding-inline: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
